---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dongho Lee Real Estate"
  description="Privacy Policy for Dongho Lee Real Estate, including how contact form and website inquiry information may be collected and used."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <header>
      <p class="page-kicker">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Dongho Lee Real Estate respects your privacy. This policy explains how information submitted through this website may be collected, used, and protected when you contact us about real estate services in Ontario.
        </p>
        <p><strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 본 정책은 이 웹사이트에서 문의·구독·분석·광고 기능을 이용할 때 정보가 어떻게 처리될 수 있는지 설명합니다. 실제 처리 방식은 사용 중인 기능과 사용자의 위치·동의 선택에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>
        <p>
          Privacy Contact: Dongho Lee 이동호, Broker, REALTOR®, HomeLife Frontier Realty Inc., Brokerage, 7620 Yonge Street, Suite 400, Thornhill, Ontario L4J 1V9. Email: <a href="mailto:contact@donlee.realtor">contact@donlee.realtor</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, email address, phone number, preferred area, and message details submitted through the contact form.</li>
          <li>Basic technical information such as browser type, device type, pages visited, and referral source when analytics or hosting logs are available.</li>
          <li>Information you voluntarily provide by phone, email, text message, or consultation request.</li>
          <li>Lead source, landing page, referral source, expected transaction timeframe, and the date and context of any marketing consent.</li>
          <li>Email address, optional first name, stated housing interest, signup source, and consent date when you subscribe to email updates.</li>
          <li>Cookie, device, browser, and online identifier information used by analytics, advertising, fraud-prevention, or consent-management technologies when those features are active and permitted.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
          Information is used to respond to inquiries, prepare for consultations, provide real estate guidance, improve website content, and maintain records related to client communication.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell contact form or subscriber information as a customer list. Information may be shared only when needed to provide requested services, comply with legal obligations, or work with service providers that support this website, including hosting, security, analytics, email delivery, consent management, and advertising.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Advertising, Google AdSense, And Consent</h2>
        <p>When advertising is enabled, this website may use Google AdSense and Google-certified consent-management tools. Google and its advertising technology partners may process cookies, device identifiers, IP-derived information, and page or ad interaction information to provide, measure, protect, and limit advertising, subject to applicable law and the choices you make in our consent message.</p>
        <p><strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 광고 기능이 활성화되면 Google AdSense 및 Google 인증 동의 관리 도구가 사용될 수 있습니다. Google 및 광고 기술 파트너는 관련 법령과 이용자의 동의 선택에 따라 광고 제공·측정·보안·부정행위 방지를 위해 쿠키, 기기 식별자, IP 기반 정보, 페이지 또는 광고 상호작용 정보를 처리할 수 있습니다.</p>
        <p>We do not control the independent privacy practices of Google or other advertising technology providers. Their processing is governed by their own notices and settings. For more information, see Google’s <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">advertising technologies information</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact Form</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit the contact form, your message is transmitted so we can respond directly. Please avoid sending highly sensitive personal, financial, or confidential documents through the website form.
        </p>
        <p>
          Contact form submissions may be processed by a third-party form, email delivery, hosting, or security provider solely for transmitting, protecting, and managing your inquiry.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data Retention And Security</h2>
        <p>
          We keep inquiry and communication records only as long as reasonably necessary for business, legal, and service purposes. Reasonable safeguards are used, but no website or email transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
        </p>
        <p>Analytics and consent information may be retained according to the settings of the relevant platform and our legitimate operational, security, and compliance needs. <strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 분석·동의 정보의 보유 기간은 관련 플랫폼 설정과 운영·보안·컴플라이언스 필요에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Marketing Messages And Consent</h2>
        <p>
          Consent to receive market updates or other commercial electronic messages is optional and separate
          from consent to process a specific inquiry. We record the source, date, and scope of express consent.
          Commercial electronic messages identify the sender and provide a working way to unsubscribe. You may
          withdraw consent at any time by using the unsubscribe method in a message or emailing
          <a href="mailto:contact@donlee.realtor">contact@donlee.realtor</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Email subscriptions may be stored and managed by our email delivery provider. Subscriber records are separated by audience interest so consumer real estate updates are not mixed with professional Realtor resources.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>CRM And Follow-up Records</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry information may be stored in a customer relationship management system to track the inquiry
          source, requested services, consent status, and appropriate follow-up. An inquiry submitted without
          marketing consent is not treated as a general newsletter subscription.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may request access, correction, or deletion of your personal information where legally available. To make a privacy request, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@donlee.realtor">contact@donlee.realtor</a>.
        </p>
        <p>You can manage or withdraw advertising and cookie consent, where available, through the <a href="/cookie-policy/#privacy-settings">Privacy and cookie settings</a> link in our site footer. You can also use browser controls to manage cookies. <strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 이용 가능한 경우 사이트 하단의 개인정보 및 쿠키 설정 링크에서 광고·쿠키 동의를 변경하거나 철회할 수 있습니다.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
